{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483260/extras/ae3299292c9ad222b009b20915ac95f2.poster.avif?t=1772220515\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483260/extras/ae3299292c9ad222b009b20915ac95f2.webm?t=1772220515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483260/extras/ae3299292c9ad222b009b20915ac95f2.mp4?t=1772220515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HEMOHOUND is a single player fast-paced FPS set in a western desert during the early 1900s where vampires stand under the sun and seek to find immortality. Traverse through desertic towns corroded by decaying hematophages seeking to stop you from reaching the primarch's resting grounds, blast your way through vampire hordes by drinking their blood to quench your thirst and steal their essence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483260/extras/6b551adc6cbab04037667e717d445edc.avif?t=1772220515\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483260/extras_big/6b551adc6cbab04037667e717d445edc.avif?t=1772220515 width=800 height=533 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VAMPIRES FEED ON EACH OTHER ON A DESPERATE BLOOD RUSH WEST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grayhill town marked as the fiends' parting point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is disease the motif of this uproar?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bodies pile up across East Dayle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483260/extras/78dae2f682cb172b62c16b4ddfb9e993.poster.avif?t=1772220515\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483260/extras/78dae2f682cb172b62c16b4ddfb9e993.webm?t=1772220515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483260/extras/78dae2f682cb172b62c16b4ddfb9e993.mp4?t=1772220515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious disease seems to be spreading across the vampire masses stripping them of their resistance to the sun's rays. These afflicted creatures drop dead suddenly appearing to rot from the inside. Investigations point that their sudden rush west indicates the possible presence of a cure most likely in the unknown Fidlands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483260/extras/32bbee9f24e65a25477c6a861535922f.poster.avif?t=1772220515\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483260/extras/32bbee9f24e65a25477c6a861535922f.webm?t=1772220515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483260/extras/32bbee9f24e65a25477c6a861535922f.mp4?t=1772220515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike experience in a fast-paced Boomer Shooter setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge up your Blood Meter and unleash brutish carnage\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform Impalaxis on weakened enemies to heal and fill the Blood Meter faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic routing through western paths each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied weapons to gun dead your kin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful upgrades and sinergies to thrive in the Blood Rush</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight Curse-Enhanced vampire bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Font: Font End Dev</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3483260?t=1772220515","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3483260?t=1772220515","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483260/7483254e3d2656522381f448a1543de3f7a6367a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772220515","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483260/7483254e3d2656522381f448a1543de3f7a6367a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772220515","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains scenes of explicit violence and gore."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483260/extras/ae3299292c9ad222b009b20915ac95f2.poster.avif?t=1772220515\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483260/extras/ae3299292c9ad222b009b20915ac95f2.webm?t=1772220515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483260/extras/ae3299292c9ad222b009b20915ac95f2.mp4?t=1772220515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HEMOHOUND is a single player fast-paced FPS set in a western desert during the early 1900s where vampires stand under the sun and seek to find immortality. Traverse through dese